    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Sa mâchoire pointue comme une lance est aussi dure que l’acier, et sa chair serait, contre toute attente, succulente.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This Pokémon has a jaw that’s as sharp as a spear and as strong as steel. Apparently Barraskewda’s flesh is surprisingly tasty, too.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "槍のように　尖った　顎は 鋼の　硬さ。　その　身は 驚くほど　美味しいらしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il charge d’un coup en faisant tourner sa nageoire caudale. Il peut transpercer ses proies à une vitesse dépassant les 100 nœuds.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It spins its tail fins to propel itself, surging forward at speeds of over 100 knots before ramming prey and spearing into them.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "尾びれを　回転させ　一気に 突撃。　１００ノットを　超える 速度で　獲物を　つらぬくぞ。",
